# The English (US) keyboard for Kidux's lessons and games: each key, upper
# and lower case, with the finger that types it and the key of the US
# keyboard it is, as Tux Typing reads it (lessons/build.py): 0 to 3 the
# left hand's little, ring, middle and index fingers, 4 and 5 the thumbs,
# 6 to 9 the right hand's index, middle, ring and little fingers. The
# keys and fingers are Tux Typing's own table's, with each key's place.
# The space keeps the short form, its finger alone: Tux Typing places it.
